WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.951
Every matching rule applies, a class beats a tag, and a comma shares a rule

2
00:00:05.552 --> 00:00:08.627
A rule on p turns every paragraph teal.

3
00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:14.823
A second rule matches the marked paragraph too. It adds a size.

4
00:00:17.146 --> 00:00:20.196
Where both set the same property, the class wins.

5
00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:26.466
A comma gives two selectors one rule. H1 comma P.
